# {{ project_name }}

Built with [vflask](https://github.com/vflask/vflask) - Modern typed Flask scaffolder.

## Installation

```bash
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
python -m pip install --upgrade pip
python -m pip install -r requirements.txt
cp .env.example .env
```

## Project commands

```bash
./scripts/start.sh
./scripts/push.sh
./scripts/help.sh
```

### Start the app

```bash
./scripts/start.sh
```

This creates the venv if needed, installs dependencies, copies `.env.example` if missing, starts Postgres and Redis, and launches the Flask dev server.

### Push changes

```bash
./scripts/push.sh "feat: add module"
```

### Help

```bash
./scripts/help.sh
```

## Creating modules

```bash
vflask module create sales -f name:string -f amount:float -f status:string:index -r admin
```